{"id":"cue-0-0","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":0,"source_end_seconds":1.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.34,"text":"直接就能立住"}
{"id":"cue-1-1340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":1.34,"source_end_seconds":2.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":1,"text":"你说的扯不扯"}
{"id":"cue-2-2340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":2.34,"source_end_seconds":3.64,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.3,"text":"现在这个互联网也是"}
{"id":"cue-3-3640","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":3.64,"source_end_seconds":5.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.52,"text":"什么五花八门的东西"}
{"id":"cue-4-5160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":5.16,"source_end_seconds":6.56,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"都想除了鸭鸭就在"}
{"id":"cue-5-6560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":6.56,"source_end_seconds":8.12,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.56,"text":"我买了件衣服"}
{"id":"cue-6-14560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-6-14560","source_start_seconds":14.56,"source_end_seconds":15.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"放您皮尺"}
{"id":"cue-7-20040","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20040","source_start_seconds":20.04,"source_end_seconds":20.84,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.8,"text":"站住"}
{"id":"cue-8-20840","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20040","source_start_seconds":20.84,"source_end_seconds":22.56,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.72,"text":"同款的衣服咱已经卖回来了"}
{"id":"cue-9-22560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20040","source_start_seconds":22.56,"source_end_seconds":23.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.32,"text":"花了我260块"}
{"id":"cue-10-23880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20040","source_start_seconds":23.88,"source_end_seconds":25.5,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.62,"text":"那花园的坑还是我们来采"}
{"id":"cue-11-25500","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20040","source_start_seconds":25.5,"source_end_seconds":26.74,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.24,"text":"免费的赞上关注"}
{"id":"cue-12-26740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20040","source_start_seconds":26.74,"source_end_seconds":27.76,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.02,"text":"麻烦您支持一个"}
{"id":"cue-13-27760","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-27760","source_start_seconds":27.76,"source_end_seconds":29.02,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.26,"text":"看了那个宣传视频"}
{"id":"cue-14-29020","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-27760","source_start_seconds":29.02,"source_end_seconds":30.52,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.5,"text":"这衣服可是挺板的"}
{"id":"cue-15-30520","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-27760","source_start_seconds":30.52,"source_end_seconds":32.32,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.8,"text":"感觉很硬的样子"}
{"id":"cue-16-32320","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-27760","source_start_seconds":32.32,"source_end_seconds":33.62,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.3,"text":"它都能自己立住"}
{"id":"cue-17-33620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-13-27760","source_start_seconds":33.62,"source_end_seconds":35.06,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.44,"text":"来 咱也打开看看"}
{"id":"cue-18-36340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-18-36340","source_start_seconds":36.34,"source_end_seconds":37.86,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.52,"text":"这衣服这个手感"}
{"id":"cue-19-38300","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-18-36340","source_start_seconds":38.3,"source_end_seconds":39.22,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.92,"text":"真不一样"}
{"id":"cue-20-39960","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-39960","source_start_seconds":39.96,"source_end_seconds":41.72,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"感觉像那个牛皮纸"}
{"id":"cue-21-41720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-39960","source_start_seconds":41.72,"source_end_seconds":42,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.28,"text":"对"}
{"id":"cue-22-42500","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-39960","source_start_seconds":42.5,"source_end_seconds":43.2,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.7,"text":"打它一样"}
{"id":"cue-23-43200","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-39960","source_start_seconds":43.2,"source_end_seconds":43.68,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.48,"text":"真硬"}
{"id":"cue-24-44060","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-39960","source_start_seconds":44.06,"source_end_seconds":45.42,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.36,"text":"来 咱也给它试试"}
{"id":"cue-25-45420","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-20-39960","source_start_seconds":45.42,"source_end_seconds":46.58,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.16,"text":"看它到底能不能立住"}
{"id":"cue-26-49290","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-49290","source_start_seconds":49.29,"source_end_seconds":50.25,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.96,"text":"确实立住了"}
{"id":"cue-27-50250","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-49290","source_start_seconds":50.25,"source_end_seconds":51.73,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"看咱一点都没碰"}
{"id":"cue-28-51730","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-49290","source_start_seconds":51.73,"source_end_seconds":53.07,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.34,"text":"来吧 您立着吧"}
{"id":"cue-29-53070","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-49290","source_start_seconds":53.07,"source_end_seconds":54.65,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.58,"text":"先来仔细看一下它这个衣服"}
{"id":"cue-30-54650","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-49290","source_start_seconds":54.65,"source_end_seconds":56.59,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"名称叫油辣甲课"}
{"id":"cue-31-56590","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-26-49290","source_start_seconds":56.59,"source_end_seconds":57.95,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.36,"text":"看来它这个说明"}
{"id":"cue-32-57950","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-57950","source_start_seconds":57.95,"source_end_seconds":59.27,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.32,"text":"是由绵制繁布"}
{"id":"cue-33-59270","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-57950","source_start_seconds":59.27,"source_end_seconds":61.13,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.86,"text":"经过上辣工艺而制成的甲课"}
{"id":"cue-34-61130","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-57950","source_start_seconds":61.13,"source_end_seconds":62.41,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.28,"text":"就有良好的防风性"}
{"id":"cue-35-62410","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-57950","source_start_seconds":62.41,"source_end_seconds":63.59,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.18,"text":"穿着立体感强烈"}
{"id":"cue-36-63590","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-57950","source_start_seconds":63.59,"source_end_seconds":65.65,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.06,"text":"看着算是又旧又老又破"}
{"id":"cue-37-65650","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-57950","source_start_seconds":65.65,"source_end_seconds":67.09,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.44,"text":"但是你看看它这个走线"}
{"id":"cue-38-67090","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-38-67090","source_start_seconds":67.09,"source_end_seconds":68.69,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"确实还是挺不错"}
{"id":"cue-39-68690","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-38-67090","source_start_seconds":68.69,"source_end_seconds":69.41,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.72,"text":"很公正"}
{"id":"cue-40-69410","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-38-67090","source_start_seconds":69.41,"source_end_seconds":70.73,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.32,"text":"包括这个扣子的地位"}
{"id":"cue-41-70730","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-38-67090","source_start_seconds":70.73,"source_end_seconds":72.43,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"还有这个袖口的部位"}
{"id":"cue-42-72430","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-38-67090","source_start_seconds":72.43,"source_end_seconds":74.37,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"看看线还是很密集"}
{"id":"cue-43-74370","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-38-67090","source_start_seconds":74.37,"source_end_seconds":75.23,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.86,"text":"很规整的"}
{"id":"cue-44-75230","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-44-75230","source_start_seconds":75.23,"source_end_seconds":75.77,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.54,"text":"你别说"}
{"id":"cue-45-75770","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-44-75230","source_start_seconds":75.77,"source_end_seconds":77.57,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.8,"text":"这衣服还真挺难穿"}
{"id":"cue-46-77570","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-44-75230","source_start_seconds":77.57,"source_end_seconds":78.79,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"因为它特别硬"}
{"id":"cue-47-78790","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-44-75230","source_start_seconds":78.79,"source_end_seconds":81.17,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.38,"text":"现在动着都受局限"}
{"id":"cue-48-81170","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-81170","source_start_seconds":81.17,"source_end_seconds":83.05,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.88,"text":"有点像那个机械眼"}
{"id":"cue-49-83050","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-81170","source_start_seconds":83.05,"source_end_seconds":84.83,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.78,"text":"像那种机械舞那种感觉"}
{"id":"cue-50-84830","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-81170","source_start_seconds":84.83,"source_end_seconds":87.31,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.48,"text":"这个油辣甲课按照这个说明"}
{"id":"cue-51-87850","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-81170","source_start_seconds":87.85,"source_end_seconds":89.79,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.94,"text":"穿着前提是比较硬的"}
{"id":"cue-52-89790","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-81170","source_start_seconds":89.79,"source_end_seconds":91.33,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.54,"text":"会使人体体温的甲热"}
{"id":"cue-53-91330","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-91330","source_start_seconds":91.33,"source_end_seconds":92.35,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.02,"text":"逐渐软化材料"}
{"id":"cue-54-92350","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-91330","source_start_seconds":92.35,"source_end_seconds":94.65,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.3,"text":"穿着属于我们个人的绝版特性"}
{"id":"cue-55-94650","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-91330","source_start_seconds":94.65,"source_end_seconds":95.73,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.08,"text":"就说白了"}
{"id":"cue-56-95730","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-91330","source_start_seconds":95.73,"source_end_seconds":97.57,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.84,"text":"咱经常动这个部位"}
{"id":"cue-57-97570","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-91330","source_start_seconds":97.57,"source_end_seconds":98.97,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"这辣慢慢会掉的"}
{"id":"cue-58-98970","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-53-91330","source_start_seconds":98.97,"source_end_seconds":100.99,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.02,"text":"他也给咱带了一盒这个风辣"}
{"id":"cue-59-100990","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-59-100990","source_start_seconds":100.99,"source_end_seconds":102.49,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.5,"text":"就是哪块颜色变浅"}
{"id":"cue-60-102490","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-59-100990","source_start_seconds":102.49,"source_end_seconds":103.53,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"你接受不了之后"}
{"id":"cue-61-103530","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-59-100990","source_start_seconds":103.53,"source_end_seconds":104.73,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.2,"text":"你把这个辣涂上"}
{"id":"cue-62-104730","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-59-100990","source_start_seconds":104.73,"source_end_seconds":105.71,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"高这个吹出你一吹"}
{"id":"cue-63-105710","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-59-100990","source_start_seconds":105.71,"source_end_seconds":107.39,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.68,"text":"就变成它原来这个样子了"}
{"id":"cue-64-107390","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-59-100990","source_start_seconds":107.39,"source_end_seconds":109.97,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.58,"text":"感觉确实挺精神挺烦的"}
{"id":"cue-65-109970","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-65-109970","source_start_seconds":109.97,"source_end_seconds":112.75,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.78,"text":"你别说这衣服它挺素形的"}
{"id":"cue-66-112750","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-65-109970","source_start_seconds":112.75,"source_end_seconds":114.17,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.42,"text":"但是就是有一点"}
{"id":"cue-67-114170","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-65-109970","source_start_seconds":114.17,"source_end_seconds":116.67,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.5,"text":"它这个油辣面料是不建议水洗的"}
{"id":"cue-68-116670","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-65-109970","source_start_seconds":116.67,"source_end_seconds":117.89,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.22,"text":"如果咱给它穿脏了"}
{"id":"cue-69-117890","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-69-117890","source_start_seconds":117.89,"source_end_seconds":120.07,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.18,"text":"直接用这个湿马布擦一擦就可以了"}
{"id":"cue-70-120070","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-69-117890","source_start_seconds":120.07,"source_end_seconds":120.43,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.36,"text":"哎呦"}
{"id":"cue-71-120430","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-69-117890","source_start_seconds":120.43,"source_end_seconds":122.63,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.2,"text":"就是它这个衣服整体不都是上辣的吗"}
{"id":"cue-72-122630","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-69-117890","source_start_seconds":122.63,"source_end_seconds":124.51,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.88,"text":"所以它这个防风防雨的效果"}
{"id":"cue-73-124510","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-69-117890","source_start_seconds":124.51,"source_end_seconds":125.59,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.08,"text":"应该就是很不错的"}
{"id":"cue-74-125590","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-69-117890","source_start_seconds":125.59,"source_end_seconds":125.99,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.4,"text":"看看啊"}
{"id":"cue-75-125990","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-125990","source_start_seconds":125.99,"source_end_seconds":126.43,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.44,"text":"看看"}
{"id":"cue-76-126430","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-125990","source_start_seconds":126.43,"source_end_seconds":128.79,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.36,"text":"这水直接就一滴都不流"}
{"id":"cue-77-128790","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-125990","source_start_seconds":128.79,"source_end_seconds":130.19,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.4,"text":"大体就是这么个情况"}
{"id":"cue-78-130190","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-125990","source_start_seconds":130.19,"source_end_seconds":131.75,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.56,"text":"然后根据自己的情况"}
{"id":"cue-79-131750","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-125990","source_start_seconds":131.75,"source_end_seconds":132.61,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.86,"text":"会不会入手"}
{"id":"cue-80-132610","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-75-125990","source_start_seconds":132.61,"source_end_seconds":133.47,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.86,"text":"逐渐考虑吧"}
